          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Waisraeli watapiga kambi zao, kila mmoja akikaa mahali penye bendera yake, penye alama za ukoo wake. Watapiga kambi zao kulizunguka hema la mkutano.",
